@startuml
actor "Cameriere / Utente" as Waiter

participant "TakeOrderController\n(UI)" as UI
participant "OrderReviewDialog" as Review
participant "OrderService\n(use-case)" as OrderSvc
participant "DatabaseService\n(facade)" as DBSvc
participant "OrderDAO\n(Postgres / File)" as DAO
participant "KitchenService" as Kitchen
participant "ProductLoadingService\n(JavaFX Service)" as ProdService
participant "SearchExecutor\n(ScheduledExecutorService)" as SearchExec
participant "WaiterPoller\n(Timeline 5s)" as Poller
participant "JavaFX Thread\n(Platform.runLater)" as FXThread

== Flusso principale: creazione ordine ==
Waiter -> UI : Seleziona prodotti\nClick Send
alt E-ink mode
    UI -> UI : skip review\nsendOrderToDatabase(items)
else Standard mode
    UI -> Review : mostra dialog di conferma (modal)
    Review --> UI : conferma con note
end

UI -> OrderSvc : createOrder(items, tavolo, note, user)
OrderSvc -> DBSvc : createOrder(items, tavolo, note, user)
activate DBSvc
DBSvc -> DAO : createOrder(items, tavolo, note, user)
activate DAO
DAO --> DBSvc : orderCreated (id / success)
deactivate DAO

note right of DBSvc
  Durante la persistenza:
  - inserisce record su orders e order_items
  - può scomporre l'ordine per categoria (decomposeOrderIfNeeded)
end note

DBSvc --> OrderSvc : success / failure
deactivate DBSvc
OrderSvc --> UI : true / false

alt success
    UI -> FXThread : mostra alert di successo\n(via Platform.runLater)
    FXThread --> UI : UI aggiornata (clear cart, navigate)
else failure
    UI -> FXThread : mostra alert di errore
end

== Scomposizione / post-processing (DAO) ==
DBSvc -> DAO : decomposeOrderIfNeeded(orderId)
DAO --> DBSvc : decomposeResult
note left: impl. SQL: crea nuovi ordini per categoria e elimina l'originale.
note left: (operazione sincrona nel DAO ma logica complessa). 
== Polling e notifiche camerieri (asincrono) ==
Poller -> OrderSvc : loadReadyOrdersForWaiter() [every 5s]  -> (async)
OrderSvc -> DBSvc : getReadyOrdersForWaiter()
DBSvc --> OrderSvc : List<Order>
OrderSvc -> FXThread : update notifications UI (Platform.runLater)
FXThread --> UI : mostra card notifiche

== Caricamento prodotti & ricerca (background) ==
ProdService -> ProdService : background load (Worker)
ProdService -> FXThread : onSucceeded (handler)
FXThread --> UI : updateProductList(...)  <!-- aggiornamento UI asincrono -->
SearchExec -> SearchExec : execute(searchTask)  <!-- Task eseguito su executor -->
SearchExec -> FXThread : searchTask.onSucceeded -> updateProductList(...)

== Possibile chiamata di split da KitchenService (ad es. scheduler) ==
Kitchen -> DBSvc : splitMixedOrdersIfNeeded()  [batch]
DBSvc -> DAO : decomposeOrderIfNeeded(orderId)  <!-- riusa DAO -->

@enduml
